WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:62% align:center
Bright footage, dark footage.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.500 line:62% align:center
The controls sit on solid paper,
so they never fight the picture.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500 line:62% align:center
Now the same player over a dark scene.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000 line:62% align:center
Tab through everything. Space plays,
the arrows seek, M mutes.
